Let $q^*\colon \mathrm{Mod}_{\mathrm{Sp}_{E}}^c(\underline{R}_E) \to \mathrm{Mod}_{\mathrm{Sp}_{E}}^c(\underline{R/p}_E)$ denote base-change along $q$. Naturality of Balmer's comparison map \eqref{eq:Balmercomparisonmap} then provides a commutative square of spectra
